ma's twisted endeavors have provided Pepesha and Letana the opportunity to finally say all the things they never could in the past. As their battle comes to a climax and close, much is revealed about their relationship and Stigma.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f8r5dvWaACJvv69w3qEzjKHrn6I.jpg"},{"title":"When I Cough, It's the Two of Us","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17658","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155389","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"53237","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"211709","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"425474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"75949","synopsis":"Reinforcements sent by Unilord arrive and assist in cleaning up the aftermath of the battle with Tzveta and Kufufu. Afterward, Teru ends up with an intense cold that leads Iko to look after her and realize just how normal heroes are.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pwkbOFZCtqs9IWFbgrgfl34pKca.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":155389,"malId":53237},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:155389","mal:53237"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17658","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"155389","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"53237","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"211709","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"425474","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":4867,"title":null,"title_eng":"Shy","slug":"shy","plot":"Verso la metà del ventunesimo secolo, il mondo era sull'orlo di una Terza Guerra Mondiale, tuttavia, la comparsa di eroi da ogni parte del globo ha scongiurato la crisi, dando vita a un nuovo periodo di pace. Tra i var